{"status":"completed","summary":"Built and verified a three-node Kubernetes v1.34.12 cluster across two private LANs routed by VyOS. All nodes survived sequential restarts and recovered fully.","actions_performed":["Configured persistent VyOS routing and firewall forwarding between lan-a and lan-b.","Added persistent private-LAN routes on all Ubuntu nodes.","Installed and configured containerd, kubeadm, kubelet, and kubectl.","Initialized node2 as control plane; joined node3 and node4 as workers.","Deployed Flannel bound explicitly to enp8s0.","Verified direct cross-LAN pod traffic, CoreDNS, and ClusterIP services.","Restarted node1, node2, node3, and node4 sequentially and verified changed boot identities and recovery."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"VyOS routes lan-a and lan-b","command_ids":["cmd-5634885bc50d448f","cmd-4e810cd2447c4d83","cmd-f6d39226239b4676","cmd-ac7f4933764446e4"],"summary":"Persistent private routes select enp8s0 and VyOS; forwarding counters and successful LAN endpoint pings prove active routing."},{"requirement":"All Kubernetes members are Ready using private LAN addresses","command_ids":["cmd-7937eb8949944847"],"summary":"node2 is Ready at 10.100.215.11; node3 and node4 are Ready at 10.100.75.11 and 10.100.75.12."},{"requirement":"Management network excluded from Kubernetes data plane","command_ids":["cmd-ba53ee8e53cc4745","cmd-f45c80d9cfe04b98","cmd-7937eb8949944847"],"summary":"Flannel uses --iface=enp8s0, VXLAN local/peer addresses are private-LAN addresses, and no Kubernetes node or Flannel public IP uses 10.100.54.0/24."},{"requirement":"Cross-LAN pod networking","command_ids":["cmd-384397d3b97e485a","cmd-7937eb8949944847"],"summary":"Pods on node2 reached pods on both workers directly, and a worker pod reached the control-plane pod; all returned expected hostnames."},{"requirement":"Cluster DNS and ClusterIP services","command_ids":["cmd-384397d3b97e485a","cmd-7937eb8949944847"],"summary":"CoreDNS resolved Kubernetes and verification service FQDNs; both ClusterIP services returned live endpoints after all restarts."},{"requirement":"node1 restart persistence and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-e8e59753bff3488a","cmd-cd4ecb9634ab4b1f","cmd-dcb61f3bb9304edf","cmd-ac7f4933764446e4","cmd-f694b15cfac146fe"],"summary":"Baseline boot ID e636d872… changed to c4633ffb…; saved VyOS configuration, forwarding, LAN reachability, and cluster traffic recovered."},{"requirement":"node2 restart persistence and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-0e956edfdd6849cd","cmd-9f1092ee890c4034","cmd-c08c0bd5de5344e2","cmd-b4d161bd163f470f"],"summary":"Baseline boot ID 242af11e… changed to 3d832ed5…; control-plane services, routes, all nodes/pods, DNS, and service traffic recovered."},{"requirement":"node3 restart persistence and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-ba53ee8e53cc4745","cmd-bbafac06e31548ef","cmd-b39ac9929ffe4385","cmd-a5ea068fde9a4771","cmd-19d6ab810adf4025"],"summary":"Baseline boot ID 4b43f122… changed to 9277bb55…; kubelet/containerd, private route, Flannel, workloads, and cluster traffic recovered."},{"requirement":"node4 restart persistence and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-f45c80d9cfe04b98","cmd-04e61f88ba81471e","cmd-a05aeee38cab4ab0","cmd-3266bb9cb4df43f0","cmd-7937eb8949944847"],"summary":"Baseline boot ID 92ec88af… changed to dd0a661f…; kubelet/containerd, private route, Flannel, workloads, and full cluster functionality recovered."}]}
